WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.257
Read the video transcript Follow the three linked boxes

00:00:04.166 --> 00:00:08.928
Sending invitations is an activity A ready decision pack

00:00:08.968 --> 00:00:12.890
is an output The intended outcome is a decision

00:00:12.942 --> 00:00:18.126
based on reliable information The input-owner cards make responsibility

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:22.587
visible An agreed deadline and a controlled document reference

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.284
are more useful than assuming that somebody will send

00:00:25.363 --> 00:00:28.982
the paper At the review point check the pack

00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:33.376
against the agreed requirements A missing approval or paper

00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:36.982
remains an open gap Do not describe the pack

00:00:37.021 --> 00:00:39.284
as ready because invitations were sent
